Id: apa011i
Severity: INFO
Category: services
Check: check_apache
References: Apache httpd core directives (Include, IncludeOptional)
Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, CM-7; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The Apache configuration names more files through Include and
IncludeOptional than check_apache reads in one run (400), or names
itself round a ring until it does. The files up to the limit are
judged; the rest are not, so their Options, proxy, WebDAV and
status blocks go unreported. Review the rest by hand, or audit a
copy with fewer sites enabled.
